      "concept": "calcitonin",
      "cover": true,
      "note": "OpenStax prints 'Stimulates osteoblasts' as an effect of calcitonin. Calcitonin's established action is inhibiting osteoclasts (printed on the next line); a direct stimulating effect on osteoblasts is not well supported, and in adults calcitonin's effect is small (docs/anp-needs-author.md, calcitonin-in-adults). Covered for good and never asked.",
